flowchart LR
  Web[Aplicación web] --> Controllers[Controladores REST y OpenAPI]
  Controllers --> Auth[Identity y alcance de organización]
  Controllers --> AP[Accounts Payable]
  Controllers --> Pay[Payments]
  Controllers --> Loans[Loans]
  Controllers --> Reports[Reporting]
  Pay --> AP
  AP --> Repos[Repositorios EF Core]
  Pay --> Repos
  Loans --> Repos
  Reports --> Repos
  Auth --> Repos
  Repos --> Db[(PostgreSQL)]
